  "content_html": "<p></p><h1 style=\"text-align: right;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi5EO6fhonD7vgvXxJOj-_exuRR9LIfOi20stc11baojn4xpTKeZtHW1vsKSZIw88O3UVsAAlh_y3Z4fFGgtD7W4mTO7lLU4YvlCtZbAcVfhXujuzLOiI2SHzvh1eyIBxp9yujODQ3RTCDYREESC35NuutfGdkfPkBJvCWDVi1S5bWmcR872oXg7gdiVpM/s290/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"סמל של תשבץ\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"288\" data-original-width=\"290\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi5EO6fhonD7vgvXxJOj-_exuRR9LIfOi20stc11baojn4xpTKeZtHW1vsKSZIw88O3UVsAAlh_y3Z4fFGgtD7W4mTO7lLU4YvlCtZbAcVfhXujuzLOiI2SHzvh1eyIBxp9yujODQ3RTCDYREESC35NuutfGdkfPkBJvCWDVi1S5bWmcR872oXg7gdiVpM/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></a></div></h1><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">חידון ידע</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">👈 </span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מי מהנחלים הבאים&nbsp;<u>לא</u> מוזכר בפרשה?</span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶשְׁכּוֹל,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חִדֶּקֶל,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶרֶד,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פְּרָת,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יַבֹּק,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יַרְדֵּן</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👈 מי מבין ההרים הבאים <u>לא</u> מוזכר בפרשה?</span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חֶרְמוֹן,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֱמוֹרִי,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֵׂעִיר,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כַּרְמֶל,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חוֹרֵב</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👈 מי מבין העמים הבאים <u>לא</u> מוזכר בפרשה?</span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּנַעֲנִיִּם,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִדְיָנִים,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מוֹאֲבִים,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֱמֹרִיים,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רְפָאִים,<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַוִּים,<br /> </span></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פְּלִשְׁתִּים</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👈 התאימו בין המונים (מימין) למנויים (משמאל) - בפרשה:</span></h3><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p class=\"zfr3Q CDt4Ke\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: large; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding-top: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; vertical-align: baseline;\">1️⃣1️⃣</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">.......</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; vertical-align: baseline;\">פעמים<br /></span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">3️⃣8️⃣</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">.......חודש</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">י</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">ם<br /></span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">1️⃣1️⃣.......</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">שנ</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #212121;\">ים<br /></span></span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: red; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">1000</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #212121;\">.......ימים<br /></span></span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">1️⃣2️⃣</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">.......שנים<br /></span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">⭕</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">4️⃣</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">.......</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">ערים<br /></span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">2️⃣</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">.......</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">מלכים<br /></span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">9️⃣</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">.......אנשים<br /></span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">⭕</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">6️⃣</span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #202122; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">.......אמות</span></p></span></span><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👈 פענחו את שמות העמים המסתתרים להלן בפרשה:</span></h3><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div style=\"font-size: large; font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">רוך פתים,<br /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">רומאים,<br /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">אפרים,<br /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מנועים,<br /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מריח,<br /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מבואים</span></div></span></span><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"color: #202122;\"><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: center; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">תשבץ מדרג-אות</span></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #212121; font-size: large; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: right; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 גבוה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 חתך את התפרים<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מקשט את הפנים<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 עם קדום המוזכר בפרשה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מזור<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 תוצר השריפה<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שור</span></p><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #212121; font-size: large; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: right; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br /></div><h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #212121; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: center; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></span></h2><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חידון ידע</span></span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נחל שלא מוזכר: חִדֶּקֶל<br />הר</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שלא מוזכר:</span><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">כַּרְמֶל<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">עם</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שלא מוזכר:</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-style: inherit; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מִדְיָנִים</span></span></p><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מונים ומנויים</span></span></h3></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><ul style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">11 - ימים  (\"אַחַד עָשָׂר יוֹם מֵחֹרֵב דֶּרֶךְ הַר שֵׂעִיר עַד קָדֵשׁ בַּרְנֵעַ\")</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">40 - שנים (\"וַיְהִי בְּאַרְבָּעִים שָׁנָה\")</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">1000 - פעמים (\"יֹסֵף עֲלֵיכֶם כָּכֶם אֶלֶף פְּעָמִים\")</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">12 - אנשים (\"וָאֶקַּח מִכֶּם שְׁנֵים עָשָׂר אֲנָשִׁים\")</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">60 - ערים (\"שִׁשִּׁים עִיר כָּל חֶבֶל אַרְגֹּב\")</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">9 - אמות (\"תֵּשַׁע אַמּוֹת אָרְכָּהּ\")</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">11 - חודשים (\"בְּעַשְׁתֵּי עָשָׂר חֹדֶשׁ\")</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">38 - שנים (\"שְׁלֹשִׁים וּשְׁמֹנֶה שָׁנָה עַד תֹּם כָּל הַדּוֹר אַנְשֵׁי הַמִּלְחָמָה\")</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">2 - מלכים (\"מִיַּד שְׁנֵי מַלְכֵי הָאֱמֹרִי\")</span></span></li></ul></span><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עמים מסתתרים</span></span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כַּפְתּוֹרִים, אֱמוֹרִים, רְפָאִים, עַמּוֹנִים, חֹרִים, מוֹאֲבִים</span></span></p><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-variant-ligatures: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רם, פרם, מאפר, רפאים, מרפא, אפר, פר</span></span></p></div></div>"
}
